Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.58,0:00:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,加油啊 美俐!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.54,0:00:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.12,0:00:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,抵達終點
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.08,0:00:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害啊 美俐
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.33,0:00:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,刷新紀錄了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.50,0:00:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.04,0:00:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,這麼一來運動會的賽跑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.83,0:00:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定能拿下優勝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.16,0:00:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.04,0:00:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 你也起勁一點好嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.87,0:00:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,美俐都這麼努力練習了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.50,0:00:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,又不是我要跑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.16,0:00:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,有夠冷淡!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.08,0:00:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,負責提供建議或炒熱氣氛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.08,0:00:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不就是我們該做的嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.91,0:00:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,想要跑得快
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.12,0:00:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,就得有效率地練核心和大腿後側的肌群
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.41,0:00:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,雞群?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.16,0:00:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,從大腿肌肉開始 那些後側的肌肉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.00,0:00:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好了 夠了\N- 透過深蹲…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.37,0:01:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我還要再多練習
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.16,0:01:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼?會不會太拼了啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.20,0:01:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定要拿下金牌
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.08,0:01:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,就是這種精神 美俐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.75,0:01:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦 你也來幫她加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.16,0:01:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我要跑囉 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.16,0:01:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.28,0:01:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,就起跑位置
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.20,0:01:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,預備
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.95,0:01:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,開跑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.25,0:01:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,運動會?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.78,0:01:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,就在下週日
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.53,0:01:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我們剛剛才一起練習跑步啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.78,0:01:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,美俐跑了超久的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.53,0:01:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟我很像 都很有毅力呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.03,0:01:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你說她像誰?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.37,0:01:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.75,0:01:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,別用那種同情的眼光看著我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.25,0:01:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,真沒想過你們會參加孩子的活動呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.16,0:01:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,阿久也來參觀嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.00,0:01:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我就不去了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.45,0:01:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,那爸爸們要拍很多張照片喔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.87,0:02:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我想給阿久看
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.00,0:02:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,喔 對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.87,0:02:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,要拍多少張呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.95,0:02:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我想想…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.29,0:02:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,一百張
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.08,0:02:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,太多張了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.45,0:02:09.87,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,ねえ愛したいこれは真実？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.87,0:02:13.37,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,ただ愛されたいのは不誠実？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.37,0:02:15.58,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,もうどうすればいい
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.58,0:02:18.25,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,どうすればいいのか
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.57,0:02:24.37,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,街はいつも通り今日も
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.37,0:02:28.04,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,惚れた腫れたで色めきたつ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.04,0:02:31.54,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,エキストラは家に帰るだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.54,0:02:35.04,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,不貞腐れてやしないさ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.04,0:02:38.79,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,そんな日々を切り裂くように
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.79,0:02:42.29,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,突然現れた君は
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.29,0:02:45.79,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,痺れるような笑顔で僕の
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.79,0:02:50.62,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,心を砕いて見せた
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.57,0:02:54.82,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,ねえ愛したいこれは真実？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.82,0:02:58.45,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,ただ愛されたいのは不誠実？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.45,0:03:00.75,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,もうどうすればいい
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.75,0:03:03.50,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,どうすればいいのか
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.50,0:03:05.62,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,って分からないよ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.62,0:03:09.33,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,その頭の中が分かんない
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.33,0:03:12.87,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,でも愛想は良いとかずるいよ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.87,0:03:18.00,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,こうやってまた君のペースに飲まれてく
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.12,0:03:25.20,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,そうやってまたほら振り回されてる
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.00,0:03:35.75,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,そうやってまたほら振り回されてる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.45,0:02:09.87,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,吶 我想愛你 這是真的嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.87,0:02:13.37,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,只想被愛就不算誠實嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.37,0:02:15.58,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,到底該怎麼辦?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.58,0:02:18.25,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,怎麼辦才好呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.57,0:02:24.37,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,今天的城市依舊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.37,0:02:28.04,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,令人神魂顛倒 興奮不已
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.04,0:02:31.54,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,臨時演員只是回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.54,0:02:35.04,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,絕對不是在彆扭啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.04,0:02:38.79,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,彷彿劃破這樣的日子一般
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.79,0:02:42.29,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,突然出現的你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.29,0:02:45.79,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,帶著令人陶醉的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.79,0:02:50.62,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,讓我明白了心碎的滋味
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.57,0:02:54.82,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,吶 我想愛你 這是真的嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.82,0:02:58.45,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,只想被愛就不算誠實嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.45,0:03:00.75,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,到底該怎麼辦?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.75,0:03:03.50,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,怎麼辦才好呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.50,0:03:05.62,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,不知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.62,0:03:09.33,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,我不知道你在想什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.33,0:03:12.87,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,你卻如此惹人憐愛 真不公平
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.87,0:03:18.00,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,就這樣 我又被你拉走節奏了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.12,0:03:25.20,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,於是你看 我又被任意擺布
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.00,0:03:35.75,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,於是你看 我又被任意擺布
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.05,0:03:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,（藍天托兒所）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.37,0:04:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,#09 努力才有收穫
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.62,0:04:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,（美俐的運動會）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.16,0:04:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.91,0:04:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,喔 這麼快就回來…啦?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.66,0:04:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,臉也太可怕了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,任務圓滿達成
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.54,0:04:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,可別小看這件事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.70,0:04:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,媽媽朋友說占位置跟打仗一樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.12,0:04:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我已經做好對策
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.54,0:04:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,外行人是無法出手的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.83,0:04:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底去做了什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.40,0:04:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀 我得加快動作
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.12,0:04:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,需要幫忙嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.95,0:04:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.40,0:04:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.40,0:04:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我至少能捏飯糰…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.70,0:04:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有發燒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.12,0:04:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,零你怎麼了?還清醒嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.87,0:04:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,還是你吃了什麼壞掉的東西?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.04,0:04:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我很正常啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.00,0:05:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 真不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.33,0:05:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,居然會有這麼一天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.83,0:05:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,太誇張
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.95,0:05:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你以前連泡麵都沒幫我泡過
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.12,0:05:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,現在居然願意為了美俐…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.16,0:05:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,美俐會開心嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.08,0:05:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,這還用說嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.79,0:05:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,"零爸爸親手做的料理"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.79,0:05:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,她一定會很開心的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.58,0:05:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,去運動會到底該做什麼呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.33,0:05:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.33,0:05:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我從來沒去過
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.95,0:05:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,喔 這個啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.08,0:05:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我也跟你差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.54,0:05:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不是很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.04,0:05:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,去看孩子跑步 拍拍照
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.33,0:05:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,大聲幫忙加油?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.95,0:05:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣就可以了吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.75,0:05:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,大聲…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.87,0:05:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.58,0:05:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 看起來好好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.20,0:05:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.08,0:05:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我做了很多美俐愛吃的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.45,0:05:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,請期待今天的便當吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.20,0:05:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.95,0:05:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,今天竟然連零也一起做了飯糰呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.50,0:06:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼?零爸爸做的飯糰?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.04,0:06:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,對啊 這樣你就能使出全力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.45,0:06:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,一定會拿下金牌啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.25,0:06:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.85,0:06:11.35,UP,,0,0,0,,（藍天托兒所運動會）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.08,0:06:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,老師早安
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.12,0:06:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,早安喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.91,0:06:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.62,0:06:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好囉 美俐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.87,0:06:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸們先進去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.58,0:06:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,會在加油席看著你的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.45,0:06:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.33,0:06:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.45,0:06:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,美俐早安
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.00,0:06:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我好緊張呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.04,0:06:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我討厭跑步
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.87,0:06:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,一起加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.75,0:06:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我們也準備過去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.95,0:06:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你占的位置在哪裡?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.12,0:06:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.25,0:06:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我設下的機關奏效了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.50,0:06:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,大家一定覺得是哪個瘋子設的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.70,0:06:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害 超多台相機
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.40,0:06:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,怎能輸給他們
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.33,0:07:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.29,0:07:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我們的最厲害吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.70,0:07:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,這是在比什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.25,0:07:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 一騎爸爸早安
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.12,0:07:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀 早安
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.33,0:07:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,早安啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.70,0:07:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 帶太多東西了吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.62,0:07:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,一騎爸爸 你一定很用心做便當吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.20,0:07:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,被發現了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.54,0:07:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,從一大早就忙到不行呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.87,0:07:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好今天天氣很好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.95,0:07:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我們家小鳥啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.41,0:07:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天還做了十個晴天娃娃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.33,0:07:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,真可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.20,0:07:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,原來真的有媽媽朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.44,0:07:31.38,UP,,0,0,0,,是不是?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.15,0:07:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,每天接送孩子當然會認識啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.65,0:07:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.75,0:07:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我們在媽媽們之間人氣很旺呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.90,0:07:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,對啊 零爸爸也超有人氣的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.95,0:07:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.00,0:07:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,大家說你是憂鬱型男 超帥
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.50,0:07:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,彷彿像是冷酷的殺手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.79,0:07:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,很有神秘感
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.25,0:07:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,常…常有人這樣形容吧 零?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.20,0:07:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不過 零爸爸其實是搞笑藝人對吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.75,0:07:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.83,0:08:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,一騎爸爸才是搞笑藝人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.16,0:08:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,零爸爸是石油大亨
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.00,0:08:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,隨便啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.45,0:08:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,吐槽了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.37,0:08:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,真不愧是搞笑藝人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.54,0:08:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,說什麼啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.62,0:08:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好帥喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.12,0:08:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,第一個節目是開幕典禮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.87,0:08:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,活潑的孩子們
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.12,0:08:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,將從入場門列隊進場
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.70,0:08:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,喔 要進場了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.62,0:08:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼就從年幼組開始進場
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.20,0:08:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,一 二…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.12,0:08:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,拿出朝氣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.45,0:08:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼?我慢了一拍
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.25,0:08:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,接著是年長組
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.20,0:08:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,美俐 看這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.90,0:08:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好 雙手比耶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.25,0:08:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒喔 美俐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.15,0:08:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,超讚 可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.62,0:08:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.53,0:08:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,一騎爸爸真猛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.41,0:08:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺得出他對美俐的愛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.87,0:08:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,要那樣才對嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.08,0:08:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,藍天托兒所運動會就從現在開幕
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.79,0:08:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,學生代表海坂美俐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.25,0:09:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,請出來打個招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.04,0:09:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,加油喔 美俐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.95,0:09:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.50,0:09:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,給你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.75,0:09:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我們為了運動會做了很多練習
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.62,0:09:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我們會盡全力表現
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.41,0:09:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,各位爸爸 媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.25,0:09:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,老師和大家
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.87,0:09:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,要幫我們加油喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.12,0:09:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,太精彩了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.87,0:09:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子的爸 請安靜
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.70,0:09:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,歹勢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.08,0:09:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,第二個節目是跳舞丟球
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.45,0:09:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,跳舞丟球?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.00,0:09:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.41,0:09:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.04,0:09:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,小陽 你好可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.95,0:10:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,小鳥 千萬不能輸喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.16,0:10:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,美俐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.25,0:10:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.16,0:10:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,第四個節目是老師帶學生拔河
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.41,0:10:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,一 二 沙…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.70,0:10:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我們一定要贏
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.45,0:10:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.29,0:10:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,看我的!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.54,0:10:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,杏奈好猛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.33,0:10:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,有力就是強
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.70,0:10:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,老師超厲害的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.58,0:10:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,杏奈老師好帥氣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.87,0:10:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,第六個節目是長頸鹿班的疊羅漢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.00,0:10:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 超可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.79,0:10:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,很棒的扇形動作 完成度很高
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.16,0:10:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,美俐最棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.83,0:10:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,很好…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.20,0:11:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 你們黏太緊了!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.83,0:11:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,男女授受不親啊 死小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.20,0:11:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.16,0:11:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.29,0:11:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.79,0:11:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.75,0:11:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你說起來不像是玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.62,0:11:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,接下來是午休時間
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.33,0:11:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,大家多吃一點美味的便當
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.45,0:11:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,下午也要充滿朝氣 繼續努力喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.25,0:11:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.95,0:11:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好像在辦派對
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.37,0:11:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,看起來好好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.45,0:11:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,還有甜點喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.04,0:11:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不會吧 超豪華的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.33,0:11:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是一騎爸爸你一個人做的嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.70,0:11:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 算是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.58,0:11:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,真羨慕美俐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.25,0:11:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,陽葵也想吃
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.20,0:11:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 我做了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.20,0:11:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,盡量吃
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.75,0:11:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那就大家一起吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.58,0:11:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天啊 好開心\N- 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.54,0:11:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,媽媽?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.83,0:11:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那我們就不客氣囉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.79,0:11:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,這個炸雞好好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.16,0:11:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,就是啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.82,0:11:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,假日比較推薦去橋本醫院
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.62,0:11:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是喔 下次我去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.29,0:11:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.37,0:11:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,也吃吃看這個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.87,0:12:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,別拿出來好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.83,0:12:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 是零爸爸做的飯糰
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.00,0:12:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我想吃
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.08,0:12:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是巧克圈圈!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.12,0:12:14.87,UP,,0,0,0,,陽葵也想吃吃看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.76,0:12:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,因為美俐喜歡吃
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.87,0:12:15.96,UP,,0,0,0,,我也想吃
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.96,0:12:16.97,UP,,0,0,0,,很好吃喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.50,0:12:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧 但你放那個也…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.62,0:12:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是草莓果醬口味
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.12,0:12:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我的裡面有包軟糖
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.12,0:12:25.76,UP,,0,0,0,,是喔?好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.28,0:12:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你選的配料好少女
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.97,0:12:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你應該有試吃過吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.45,0:12:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,很好吃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.58,0:12:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我每天做好吃的菜
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.62,0:12:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,還是改變不了你的味蕾嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.79,0:12:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,全部都是美俐愛吃的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.20,0:12:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我好開心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.91,0:12:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,聽到了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.41,0:12:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝你 零爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.12,0:12:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,接下來開始進行下午的節目
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.54,0:12:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,參加賽跑的朋友們
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.25,0:12:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,請到入場門集合
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.25,0:12:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 美俐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.25,0:13:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,終於換你大顯身手了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.04,0:13:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.12,0:13:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定 一定會拿下金牌
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.87,0:13:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸們要好好看著喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.91,0:13:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你練習了很久呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.83,0:13:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,加油喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.20,0:13:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我會的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.75,0:13:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,衝啊 美俐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.00,0:13:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 加油\N- 我在看你喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.75,0:13:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,別跌倒囉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.29,0:13:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,各就各位
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.66,0:13:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.83,0:13:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小心喔\N- 跑好快
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.70,0:13:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.54,0:13:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.62,0:13:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼換下一批
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.58,0:13:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那傢伙緊張了起來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.66,0:13:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,美俐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.45,0:13:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,像平常那樣跑就好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.91,0:13:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,別緊張
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.83,0:13:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,放輕鬆
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.91,0:13:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,總覺得 連我也緊張起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.33,0:14:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,她還好嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.04,0:14:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,各就各位
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.87,0:14:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,衝啊 美俐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.37,0:14:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,把他們拋在腦後
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.45,0:14:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.83,0:14:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,就是這樣 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.00,0:14:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,加油啊 美俐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.16,0:14:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,美俐 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.16,0:14:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,衝啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.00,0:14:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 加油\N- 衝啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.99,0:14:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,咦?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.45,0:14:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.25,0:14:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,加油啊 美俐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.50,0:14:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,美俐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.37,0:14:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀 等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.83,0:14:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.20,0:14:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.08,0:15:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了 美俐
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.91,0:15:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你很努力了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.87,0:15:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,給你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.66,0:15:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,表現得很好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.70,0:15:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,唉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.87,0:15:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你們看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.79,0:15:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我拿到金牌了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.75,0:15:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,大河 幹得好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.58,0:15:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你很拼嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.04,0:15:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我很想把金牌送給爸爸們
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.87,0:15:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但是失敗了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.66,0:15:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.66,0:15:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋 你在說什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.66,0:15:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你有努力過就夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.95,0:15:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是啊 零?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.58,0:15:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,都是我害的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.20,0:15:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.62,0:15:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不…你在說什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.66,0:15:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼搞成這樣?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.87,0:15:44.84,UP,,0,0,0,,等等想參加親子競賽的父母
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.87,0:15:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你還好嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.78,0:15:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 美俐想參加
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.31,0:15:49.14,UP,,0,0,0,,請跟孩子到入場門集合
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.75,0:15:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好嘛 爸爸們
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.33,0:15:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我們一起參加吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.79,0:15:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.29,0:15:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那你呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.58,0:15:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我就…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.58,0:16:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯?這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.66,0:16:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那我們出發囉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.33,0:16:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,零爸爸 好好看著喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.16,0:16:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,這次我一定會拿到金牌的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.91,0:16:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我們拼拼看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.41,0:16:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 拼拼看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.00,0:16:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,加油這件事…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.41,0:16:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,真困難
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.50,0:16:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,下一個節目是親子賽跑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.79,0:16:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,各位學生
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.25,0:16:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,要跟爸爸 媽媽 爺爺 奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.54,0:16:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一起努力跑喔\N- 好好看著喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.25,0:16:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,零爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.00,0:16:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那就請第一批親子開跑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.41,0:16:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,請大家熱情鼓勵他們
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.12,0:16:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.41,0:16:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,加油喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.79,0:16:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,各就各位
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.83,0:16:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,預備
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.16,0:16:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,跑道上有幾個障礙物
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.04,0:17:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,請親子同心協力突破障礙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.70,0:17:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 有點心吊在空中
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.20,0:17:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,家長能背著孩子順利吃掉嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.20,0:17:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,美俐 上來
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.50,0:17:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.11,0:17:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.91,0:17:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,小鳥 振作點
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.54,0:17:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,偶先走惹
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.91,0:17:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那個混蛋…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.04,0:17:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,接下來
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.04,0:17:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,要請親子一起穿著超大的褲子跑步
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.94,0:17:30.07,UP,,0,0,0,,一 二…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.36,0:17:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,小心不要跌倒囉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.16,0:17:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 大河
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.08,0:17:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,就是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.50,0:17:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,一 二…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.54,0:17:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,快一點…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.66,0:17:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.45,0:17:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,美俐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.62,0:17:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.54,0:17:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,別放棄 我們還有機會
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.66,0:17:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.66,0:17:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,一 二…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.50,0:17:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.58,0:17:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 接下來是借物賽跑
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.41,0:17:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,箱子裡有寫了各種東西的卡片
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.12,0:17:57.08,UP,,0,0,0,,這個
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.90,0:18:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,請借到卡片上寫的東西之後
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.34,0:18:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,朝終點衝刺
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.41,0:18:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,小心安全喔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.58,0:18:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.12,0:18:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,上面寫了什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.91,0:18:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,美俐?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.16,0:18:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,啊?什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.95,0:18:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去哪裡?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.20,0:18:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,零爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.20,0:18:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我走
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.70,0:18:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.95,0:18:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,快一點…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.70,0:18:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我一起走
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.25,0:18:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸們 快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.95,0:18:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.83,0:19:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.33,0:19:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,石油大亨好帥啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.20,0:19:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好快 超快的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.25,0:19:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,抵達終點!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.12,0:19:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.08,0:19:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.91,0:19:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,拿到金牌了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.20,0:19:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 美俐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.70,0:19:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我好高興
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.54,0:19:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你超努力的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.25,0:19:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.50,0:19:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,對了 美俐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.87,0:19:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那張卡片上寫了什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.12,0:19:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.54,0:19:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼是去找零呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.70,0:19:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,這個嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.20,0:19:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.75,0:19:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,（家人）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.70,0:20:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,別哭出來喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.91,0:20:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.87,0:20:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你還好意思說
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.25,0:20:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.16,0:20:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,家…人…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.41,0:20:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸明明是大人卻在哭
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.03,0:20:20.54,UP,,0,0,0,,（家人）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.90,0:20:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,臉好好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.33,0:20:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,稍作休息之後
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.12,0:20:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,進行最後一個項目
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.04,0:20:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,然後就是閉幕典禮了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.08,0:20:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,各位家長請務必為孩子加油到最後
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.83,0:20:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,請好好補充水分喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.20,0:20:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,美俐 恭喜你拿到第一名
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.91,0:20:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,杏奈你看 是金牌耶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.08,0:20:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,對啊 你好帥氣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.25,0:20:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,對了 願意的話
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.04,0:20:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸們要不要跟美俐拍張紀念照?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.50,0:20:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以幫忙拍喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.04,0:20:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.08,0:21:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,可以拍照嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.79,0:21:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,把我們也拍進去是不是不太妙?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.50,0:21:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.70,0:21:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,希望盡量不要留下痕跡…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.95,0:21:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸們 快點啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.83,0:21:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,跟美俐和金牌一起合照嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.29,0:21:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,拿她沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.33,0:21:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,就只拍一張吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.79,0:21:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 那要笑一個喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.41,0:21:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,一加一等於?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.29,0:21:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,二
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.70,0:21:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,今天的運動會到此結束
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.41,0:21:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,大家回家小心喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.16,0:21:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.75,0:21:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉了 零
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.37,0:21:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我的腰好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.29,0:21:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,剛剛太賣命了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.12,0:21:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,人要服老
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.50,0:21:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.79,0:21:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,這傢伙睡得超熟的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.87,0:21:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,因為她很努力
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.16,0:21:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你也很努力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.91,0:21:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,大聲幫她加油
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.54,0:22:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,希望她明年連個人賽跑也拿金牌
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.66,0:22:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,繼續練習吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.54,0:22:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.91,0:22:21.29,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,変わらない光景予想外の 毎日だけど
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.29,0:22:23.41,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,それがいいって
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.41,0:22:28.45,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,振り回されたり空回って
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.45,0:22:33.37,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,目まぐるしく愛おしい日を
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.37,0:22:35.70,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,眠れない夜にそっと
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.70,0:22:37.66,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,口ずさむ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.66,0:22:42.83,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,子守唄や呼吸に合わせた手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.83,0:22:45.33,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,ただただ一日でも
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.33,0:22:47.16,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,この日々が
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.16,0:22:52.66,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,長く長く長く長く続くように
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.66,0:22:57.54,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,裸足で駆ける君を追った
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.54,0:23:01.91,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,いつか僕を超えて Ah
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.91,0:23:06.62,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,明日はどんな一日だろうな
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.62,0:23:11.37,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,僕ら一緒に歩いてこうか
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.37,0:23:16.70,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,いつもここに帰る場所があって
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.70,0:23:20.95,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,悲しみも照らすように
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.95,0:23:23.33,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,それでもいいか
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.33,0:23:25.75,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,それもありかな
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.75,0:23:30.75,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,僕らの愛を分かち合おうか
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.75,0:23:36.00,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,予想出来ない未来には希望を
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.00,0:23:40.83,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,いつまでも照らして
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.91,0:22:21.29,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,不變的風景 每天都出乎意料
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.29,0:22:23.41,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,但這樣也不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.41,0:22:28.45,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,被折騰一番 白忙一場
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.45,0:22:33.37,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,過著眼花撩亂 令人疼惜的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.37,0:22:35.70,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,在睡不著的夜裡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.70,0:22:37.66,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,輕輕哼唱著
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.66,0:22:42.83,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,手配合著搖籃曲和呼吸拍著
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.83,0:22:45.33,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,就算只有一天也好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.33,0:22:47.16,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,希望這樣的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.16,0:22:52.66,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,能夠持續長長久久
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.66,0:22:57.54,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,追逐著赤腳奔跑的你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.54,0:23:01.91,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,總有一天會超越我 Ah
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.91,0:23:06.62,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,明天會是怎樣的一天呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.62,0:23:11.37,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,我們會一起走下去嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.37,0:23:16.70,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,在這裡永遠有我的歸處
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.70,0:23:20.95,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,希望連同悲傷都照亮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.95,0:23:23.33,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,即便如此也可以嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.33,0:23:25.75,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,這樣可能嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.75,0:23:30.75,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,應該分享我們的愛嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.75,0:23:36.00,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,願在不可預知的未來裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.00,0:23:40.83,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,永遠閃耀著希望
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.29,0:23:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,別忘了你的工作
